<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<sc-for list="{{plMoods}}" as="o" hint-placeholder-count="3">
<button onClick="{{o.pick}}" aria-pressed="{{o.on}}" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 2px; min-height: 58px; padding: 10px 14px; text-align: left; background: {{o.bg}}; color: {{o.fg}}; border: 2px solid {{o.bd}}; border-radius: 12px; cursor: pointer; font-family: 'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">{{o.label}}</span><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.35">{{o.sub}}</span></button>
</sc-for>
</div>
<span style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #A8A36A">Ton appli</span>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 8px">
<sc-for list="{{plPlats}}" as="o" hint-placeholder-count="3">
<button onClick="{{o.pick}}" aria-pressed="{{o.on}}" style="min-height: 48px; padding: 4px 6px; background: {{o.bg}}; color: {{o.fg}}; border: 2px solid {{o.bd}}; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; font-family: 'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif">{{o.label}}</button>
</sc-for>
</div>
<a href="{{plUrl}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 54px; background: #F2E415; color: #12110C; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none; text-align: center; padding: 0 12px">{{plCta}}</a>
</div>
</section>
<section id="recuperer" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; padding: 44px 20px; background: #807C3A; color: #12110C">
<div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase">Pilier 2 · Récupérer</div>
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: Anton, Impact, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1; text-transform: uppercase">Récupérer, c'est s'entraîner</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5">C'est entre les séances que le muscle se construit. Bien s'étirer, bien dormir, bouger les jours de repos : ça fait partie du programme.</p>
<span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Quand s'étirer ?</span>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; background: #E4E1B8; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #4A4620">Avant la séance</span><span style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px">Mobilité dynamique</span><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.4">Préparer les articulations sans perdre de force : cercles de hanches, fentes en mouvement, chat-vache.</span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; background: #E4E1B8; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px"><span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #4A4620">Juste après</span><span style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px">Retour au calme doux, 5 min</span><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.4">20 à 30 secondes par position, en respirant. On ne tire pas fort sur un muscle qui vient de travailler lourd.</span></div>
